    {
      "fileName": "hells-armaments.json",
      "id": "J5s7NeFHYuFSdhrX",
      "name": "Hell's Armaments",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "J5s7NeFHYuFSdhrX",
        "folder": "meMFFdAduCrksghE",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Hell's Armaments",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've trained relentlessly with your order's weapon to maximize their deadliness. When you get a critical success on a Strike with one of your order's favored weapons, the target must attempt a @Check[fortitude|against:class] save against your class DC. If you have access to that weapon's critical specialization effect, you must choose whether to use that effect or this one.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 2} until the end of your next turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 12
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Hellknight Preferment"
              },
              {
                "value": "expert in at least one of your order's favored weapons"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Hellfire Dispatches"
          },
